    "tagLine": "Flexible Terms, All Inclusive Studios, Start your Co-living Adventure in the heart of the City!",
    "location": "Dublin 7 is in one of the coolest neighborhoods to live, Time Out Magazine recently named Dublin 7 as one of the most vibrant areas to be living across the globe. With a mix of history, culture and arts this is certainly the place to live and  discover Dublin's hidden gems.\r\n\r\nTake a stroll to Dublin's iconic O’Connell Street or hop on the Luas, a 4-minute walk away, or venture into St Stephens Green for some shopping. Check out Mc Gowans pub for a pint of the black stuff or pop into the Jameson Whiskey Distillery to learn how one of Ireland's most famous exports is made. There is Bonobo for the pizza, Token for pints & retro arcade games, Krewe for the cocktails & chicken wings – Dublin 7 has it all. \r\n\r\nBus routes include the 16, 16D, 38, 38A, 41C, 41D, and 46A.\r\nDirect connection to the Airport via Bus 16, just a short walk from Node."
  },
